  }, {
    "tStartMs": 340640,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I got my sister to design the\npackaging. She got 5% profit sharing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344840,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Um and then we made the 5,000 pieces and\nwe started selling on in streets of"
