  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367960,
    "dDurationMs": 1040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e Yeah.\n\u003e\u003e Yeah.",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368440,
    "dDurationMs": 3800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e And what\n\u003e\u003e does how does that happen? Like, did you",
