    "tStartMs": 387680,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Palace in Auburn Hills, where the\nDetroit the Detroit Pistons played."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 391800,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Anton called me, said, \"Do you have\nany connections to Kmart Corporation?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 395400,
    "dDurationMs": 4640,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Aaron said, \"Sure.\" He said, \"We can\nget you a meeting.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 398160,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, that's how it happened. And for some\nreason, okay, Anton was doing sales, I"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 401840,
    "dDurationMs": 5320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was doing operations, but for some\nreason I took the sales call."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 405400,
    "dDurationMs": 4720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I woke up at 3:30 in the morning,\nokay? [laughter]"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 408040,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I woke up at 3:30. And I didn't even\nthink about like booking a hotel. I just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 411919,
    "dDurationMs": 5761,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "woke up at 3:30. I get to the\nappointment at uh 9:00."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 416120,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I'm sitting there, it's myself, the\nrep, Aaron, the buyer, in a boardroom."
