  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420200,
    "dDurationMs": 4719,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And\nI do a 30-minute pitch. And he sits"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423360,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there, he doesn't say anything.\nAnd then at the end of the 30-minute"
